    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Cell offsets from scan_ptr for directions 0-3: left $28, up $01, right $2a, down $51."},
    {"at":4,"placement":"line","text":"Cell offsets of dir_offsets one step back: entry d is dir_offsets entry d-1."},
    {"at":8,"placement":"line","text":"Clears X when the cell at scan_ptr+Y is Rockford ($38, $39) or amoeba ($3a)."},
